      "origin": "CDNCA original; no upstream equivalent",
      "adaptation": "New nginx variable $modsecurity_rule_ids: the IDs of the rule messages the request's own transaction keeps (msc_get_rules_messages_rule_ids, the rules with log), ',<id>,...,' (',' for none), not found without a transaction; not cacheable. Lets Lua read a transaction outcome in the log phase without libmodsecurity's process-wide setenv."
